1
00:00:01,000 --> 00:00:05,200
India is not a single market.

2
00:00:05,200 --> 00:00:09,800
It is twenty-two linguistic regions, each defined by distinct cultural festivals,

3
00:00:09,800 --> 00:00:13,800
visual aesthetics, and local consumer sentiments.

4
00:00:13,800 --> 00:00:18,200
Every marketing team and e-commerce brand operating in India faces a fundamental crisis:

5
00:00:18,200 --> 00:00:22,200
India is not a monolithic market.

6
00:00:22,200 --> 00:00:27,000
It is a continent of twenty-two official languages, hundreds of regional dialects,

7
00:00:27,000 --> 00:00:32,000
and dozens of distinct festive cultures running simultaneously across the calendar year.

8
00:00:32,000 --> 00:00:36,800
When festive seasons arrive—whether it is Diwali in Uttar Pradesh,

9
00:00:36,800 --> 00:00:41,200
Durga Puja in Bengal, Pongal in Tamil Nadu, or Ningol Chakouba in Manipur—

10
00:00:41,200 --> 00:00:47,000
regional consumers demand visual relevance, localized cultural symbolism, and native-script communication.

11
00:00:47,000 --> 00:00:52,500
Welcome to PixelPradesh—an autonomous regional media localization engine built entirely on the power of Cloudinary AI.

12
00:00:52,500 --> 00:00:57,800
PixelPradesh turns a single studio photograph into a complete, culturally nuanced, multi-format campaign in seconds.

13
00:00:57,800 --> 00:01:03,000
At the core of this entire engine is Cloudinary’s Programmable Media infrastructure,

14
00:01:03,000 --> 00:01:08,500
which executes every phase of localization autonomously on the edge through chained transformations.

15
00:01:08,500 --> 00:01:14,000
First, Cloudinary anchors the master product geometry, preserving authentic product textures,

16
00:01:14,000 --> 00:01:19,800
proportions, and logo boundaries with a structural similarity score exceeding ninety-eight percent.

17
00:01:19,800 --> 00:01:25,000
Second, the engine calls Cloudinary’s cutting-edge Generative Background Replace.

18
00:01:25,000 --> 00:01:29,800
Instead of static template swaps, Cloudinary uses contextual generative AI

19
00:01:29,800 --> 00:01:34,500
to completely synthesize authentic regional environments:

20
00:01:34,500 --> 00:01:39,800
warm festive diyas and marigold garlands for North India, terracotta craftsmanship for Bengal,

21
00:01:39,800 --> 00:01:45,000
traditional kolam courtyards for Tamil Nadu, and indigenous celebratory motifs for Manipur.

22
00:01:45,000 --> 00:01:50,000
Third, to eliminate awkward manual cropping across different ad channels, the engine leverages Cloudinary’s Generative Fill.

23
00:01:50,000 --> 00:01:55,800
Cloudinary autonomously outcolors and extends canvas boundaries to exact aspect ratios—

24
00:01:55,800 --> 00:02:01,200
one-to-one feed, nine-by-sixteen vertical stories, and sixteen-by-nine display banners—

25
00:02:01,200 --> 00:02:05,800
seamlessly synthesizing realistic peripheral detail.

26
00:02:05,800 --> 00:02:11,000
Fourth, Cloudinary’s dynamic text layering engine injects localized headlines and calls-to-action

27
00:02:11,000 --> 00:02:16,500
directly onto the image using authentic Indic fonts—including Devanagari, Bengali, Tamil, and Meitei—

28
00:02:16,500 --> 00:02:21,000
automatically aligned with platform-compliant safe margins.

29
00:02:21,000 --> 00:02:26,500
Through our interactive Studio Lightbox, marketing teams can inspect the Before-After split slider,

30
00:02:26,500 --> 00:02:31,800
verify live Meta Reels safe zones, and review the exact chained Cloudinary URL recipe that powers every single creative.

31
00:02:31,800 --> 00:02:37,500
One product photograph. Four regional markets. Three distribution formats.

32
00:02:37,500 --> 00:02:42,500
Twelve broadcast-ready campaign creatives delivered autonomously in seconds.

33
00:02:42,500 --> 00:02:49,000
PixelPradesh transforms regional localization from an expensive multi-week bottleneck into an instantaneous, AI-powered competitive advantage—

34
00:02:49,000 --> 00:02:53,280
driven end-to-end by Cloudinary AI for HackIndia 2026. Thank you!
